{"type":"message","id":"9582669d","parentId":"3300f311","timestamp":"2026-04-13T09:48:40.473Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在问Openclaw有没有自带的backup功能，首先我应该先查本地的文档或者用openclaw命令看看backup相关的功能对吧？首先先跑openclaw help看看有没有backup相关的命令？或者直接搜openclaw backup相关的功能？\n\n首先调用exec工具，运行openclaw help backup或者openclaw backup --help？不对，先直接运行openclaw backup --help看看有没有这个命令吧。或者先看文档？不过先试试命令行最快。\n\n对，先执行openclaw backup --help看看有没有自带的功能。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_xngwjamnjjryn895n6xfvob9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw backup --help"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776073713304,"responseId":"021776073713844e4feb8d226730241afb8b5c4c4c35b3258b312"}}
