{"type":"message","id":"ff5b5390","parentId":"4518499c","timestamp":"2026-04-13T15:44:26.706Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在问HEARTBEAT是怎么执行任务的，是不是调用脚本。首先我需要先回忆下OpenClaw的HEARTBEAT机制，然后找相关的文件或者执行逻辑。首先先看看HEARTBEAT的相关实现，或者先执行命令看看有没有heartbeat相关的cli命令？比如openclaw heartbeat --help？\n对，先跑这个命令看看官方的说明。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_p4mjxkl4li91ub1kfx6u0qme","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw heartbeat --help"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776095051075,"responseId":"021776095054051e4feb8d226730241afb8b5c4c4c35b3295f071"}}
