{"type":"message","id":"28f88c8e","parentId":"14c1382a","timestamp":"2026-04-13T15:45:09.550Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n哦，看来heartbeat是内置的机制，不是单独的命令？那我应该去看系统里的HEARTBEAT相关的实现，或者去docs里找相关的说明？对，先看看OpenClaw的docs里有没有heartbeat相关的文档，路径是/app/docs对吧，之前的项目上下文里说的。\n所以先read /app/docs/features/heartbeat.md 看看有没有这个文件，要是有的话就能知道执行逻辑了。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_tmi0wka6xr1gdgntkz47t2pe","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/app/docs/features/heartbeat.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776095093331,"responseId":"021776095094629e4feb8d226730241afb8b5c4c4c35b3279ac65"}}
