{"type":"message","id":"29619a86","parentId":"a1a0e1c8","timestamp":"2026-04-13T15:47:41.396Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System (untrusted): [2026-04-13 15:45:36 UTC] Exec completed (tidal-ce, code 1) :: ns][39m [36mfeishu_drive: Registered feishu_drive tool[39m [35m[plugins][39m [36mfeishu_bitable: Registered bitable tools[39m [openclaw] Failed to start CLI: Error: The `openclaw …\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52e54f595ca8ee7d2ac3478d86f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-04-13 15:47 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b52e54f595ca8ee7d2ac3478d86f]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 是如何检查节点连通性的，我说的节点可是qitmeer网络的全节点哦"}],"timestamp":1776095261394}}
{"type":"message","id":"66d8bf77","parentId":"29619a86","timestamp":"2026-04-13T15:47:53.880Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在问的是HEARTBEAT怎么检查qitmeer网络的全节点连通性，首先我得先搞清楚当前的配置里有没有相关的检查逻辑，首先先搜索一下内存里有没有相关的qitmeer的配置，或者看看有没有相关的脚本，首先先看看当前工作区里有没有相关的qitmeer检查脚本？\n\n首先先执行find命令看看工作区里有没有相关的qitmeer文件吧，比如find /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus -name \"*qitmeer*\"\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_upuhs9jjaltq9t9db6bjkx9p","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"find /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus -name \"*qitmeer*\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776095261396,"responseId":"021776095262683e4feb8d226730241afb8b5c4c4c35b327b80c7"}}
